    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "When deploying a new service takes a developer two days of yak-shaving through infrastructure configuration, the team will deploy new services infrequently and pack too much functionality into existing ones. When deploying a new service takes thirty minutes and produces a service that is already instrumented, monitored, and deployable, the team will architect systems with appropriate boundaries. The platform is the cultural infrastructure for DevOps."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.h3, {
