    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "Architectural decision records (ADRs) and architecture review processes are often experienced as bureaucratic overhead. In a healthy DevOps culture, they serve a different function: structured opportunities for the organization to learn from the design decisions that shaped its current system and to make better-informed decisions about future ones."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
